{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fred's Idle Garden is an <strong>idle farming simulator</strong> which sits on your desktop while you do other things.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786640/extras/b85b89ba4443046c118d7ac3038577cd.poster.avif?t=1770284767\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786640/extras/b85b89ba4443046c118d7ac3038577cd.webm?t=1770284767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786640/extras/b85b89ba4443046c118d7ac3038577cd.mp4?t=1770284767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow &amp; harvest crops\u00a0</strong>\ud83e\udd55\ud83c\udf3d\ud83c\udf45\ud83e\udd52</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow various crops and watch the coins roll in!\u00a0Use your shiny earnings to unlock even more crops, upgrade your characters abilities and buy some nice decorations for your garden. Expand your garden and farm more crops.\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run your own little cozy shop \ud83c\udfe1 \ud83d\udcc8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have grown and harvested your crops, you\u2019ll also need a place to sell them! Manage your shop, making sure it's stocked with the crops your customers crave. Keep them happy, and watch your little business thrive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate your garden \ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3c\ud83c\udf37\ud83c\udf35</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your garden with plants and trees to create your own cozy little place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully automated \u267e\ufe0f \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf3e\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf3e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fred's Idle Garden is a great game for farming multitaskers! Your character does all the hard farm work while you do your own thing.\u00a0You can place the game wherever you want on your screen, zoom in and out, and it'll quietly do its thing without getting in your way. When you feel like it get back and add new things to your garden or upgrade your character.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3786640?t=1770284767","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3786640?t=1770284767","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786640/404efa4672dd3e973cbd777aee5fb19011c89bf3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770284767","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786640/404efa4672dd3e973cbd777aee5fb19011c89bf3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770284767","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3828810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fred's Idle Garden is an <strong>idle farming simulator</strong> which sits on your desktop while you do other things.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786640/extras/b85b89ba4443046c118d7ac3038577cd.poster.avif?t=1770284767\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786640/extras/b85b89ba4443046c118d7ac3038577cd.webm?t=1770284767\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786640/extras/b85b89ba4443046c118d7ac3038577cd.mp4?t=1770284767\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow &amp; harvest crops\u00a0</strong>\ud83e\udd55\ud83c\udf3d\ud83c\udf45\ud83e\udd52</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow various crops and watch the coins roll in!\u00a0Use your shiny earnings to unlock even more crops, upgrade your characters abilities and buy some nice decorations for your garden. Expand your garden and farm more crops.\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run your own little cozy shop \ud83c\udfe1 \ud83d\udcc8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have grown and harvested your crops, you\u2019ll also need a place to sell them! Manage your shop, making sure it's stocked with the crops your customers crave. Keep them happy, and watch your little business thrive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate your garden \ud83c\udf33\ud83c\udf3c\ud83c\udf37\ud83c\udf35</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your garden with plants and trees to create your own cozy little place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully automated \u267e\ufe0f \ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf3e\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf3e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fred's Idle Garden is a great game for farming multitaskers! Your character does all the hard farm work while you do your own thing.\u00a0You can place the game wherever you want on your screen, zoom in and out, and it'll quietly do its thing without getting in your way. When you feel like it get back and add new things to your garden or upgrade your character.</p>","developers":["Pretty Fly Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786640/5a4f37c98eccb48aa921badc1ce73486a15682a8/header.jpg?t=1770284767","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recomm